#. +> trunk
#: documentation_part.cpp:216
msgid ""
"<b>Search in documentation</b>"
"<p>Opens the Search in documentation tab. It allows a search term to be entered which will be searched for in the documentation. For this to work, a full text index must be created first, which can be done in the configuration dialog of the documentation plugin."
msgstr ""
"<b>Binnen Dokmentatschoon söken</b>"
"<p>Maakt de Paneelsiet för't Söken binnen den Dokmentatschoon-Heeltext op. Dor kannst Du en Begreep op ingeven, na den Du binnen de Dokmentatschoon söken wullt. Schall dit funkscheneren, muttst Du toeerst en Index för den Heeltext opstellen, wat Du binnen den Instellendialoog vun't Dokmentatschoon-Moduul doon kannst."

#. +> trunk
#: documentation_part.cpp:223
msgid "&Look in Documentation Index..."
msgstr "Dokmentatschoon-&Index dörkieken..."

#. +> trunk
#: documentation_part.cpp:226
msgid "Look in the documentation index"
msgstr "Binnen den Dokmentatschoon-Index kieken"

#. +> trunk
#: documentation_part.cpp:227 documentation_part.cpp:479
msgid ""
"<b>Look in documentation index</b>"
"<p>Opens the documentation index tab. It allows a term to be entered which will be looked for in the documentation index."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dokmentatschoon-Index dörkieken</b>"
"<p>Maakt de Paneelsiet mit den Dokmentatschoon-Index op. Dor kannst Du en Begreep op ingeven, den Du binnen den Dokmentatschoon-Index söken wullt."

